---
layout: layouts/world.njk
title: Public Orientation and Literacy
description: Start with a human question, then explore how it connects to the larger AI transition.
permalink: /understand/index.html
robots: noindex, nofollow
bodyClass: world-model-preview-body
---
<div class="wm-preview-ribbon" role="status">{{ worldModelPreview.status }} · Search engines excluded</div>

<section class="wm-understand-hero section-shell">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Understand</p>
    <h1>What are you trying to understand?</h1>
    <p class="lede">Start with a question. See what we know, what may be changing, and how it connects to the larger picture.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wm-hero-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
</section>

<section class="wm-question-entry section-shell" aria-labelledby="question-entry-heading">
  <div class="wm-section-rule"><span></span><p id="question-entry-heading">Start with something that matters to you</p><span></span></div>
  <div class="wm-question-grid">
    {% for item in worldModelPreview.questions %}
      {% if item.active %}<a class="wm-question-card" href="/understand/questions/{{ item.slug }}/">{% else %}<article class="wm-question-card is-coming" aria-disabled="true">{% endif %}
        <span class="wm-question-number">{{ item.glyph }}</span>
        <h2>{{ item.question }}</h2>
        <p>{{ item.state }}</p>
        <strong aria-hidden="true">{% if item.active %}→{% else %}In development{% endif %}</strong>
      {% if item.active %}</a>{% else %}</article>{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wm-whole-system section-shell" aria-labelledby="whole-system-heading">
  <div class="wm-section-rule"><span></span><p>Or explore the whole system</p><span></span></div>
  <div class="wm-system-card">
    <div class="wm-mini-domain-field" aria-hidden="true">
      {% for domain in worldModelPreview.domains %}<span class="tone-{{ domain.tone }}">{{ domain.glyph }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The Hii World Model</p>
      <h2 id="whole-system-heading">See the whole system.</h2>
      <p>Explore the model that connects domains, signals, relationships, and evidence without collapsing uncertainty into one answer.</p>
      <a class="button-link wm-primary-action" href="/understand/world-model/">Explore the World Model <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wm-system-close"><p>See the whole system. <span>•</span> Make sense of what is happening. <span>•</span> Stay oriented. <span>•</span> Act wisely together.</p></section>
